---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
import "../../styles/water-tank.css"
import "aos/dist/aos.css";
const currentYear = new Date().getFullYear();
import { getSEO } from "../../utils/getSEO";
const seo = getSEO("water-tanks-service");
---

<Layout title={seo.title} description={seo.description} keywords={seo.keywords}>
    <section>
<div class="inner-banner">
  <div class="inner-banner-content">
    <h1>Services</h1>
    <p>Home / Services</p>
  </div>
  </div>
</section>
  <!-- ============================= -->
  <!-- 1) PLUMBING SERVICES (Left Image) -->
  <!-- ============================= -->
<section class="services-section">

  <div class="section-wrapper plumbing-wrapper" id="irrigation-services">

    <!-- IMAGE -->
    <div class="plumbing-image-box">
      <div class="dots"></div>
      <img src="/servicesimages/imgi_3_plumbing-services.png" class="section-img" alt="Irrigation Services
" data-aos="fade-right">
    </div>

    <!-- TEXT -->
    <div class="plumbing-content">
      <h2   class="section-title section-title reveal-letters">Water Tanks <br>Refurbishment/Installation
</h2>
      <p   class="section-text" data-aos="fade-up">
At TWS, we deliver comprehensive water tank solutions tailored to meet the demands of both domestic and commercial environments. 
Our services cover thefull lifecycle of water tanks—specialising in the refurbishment, installation, and scheduled maintenance of 
drinking water supply tanks and fire water storage systems.

      </p>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>
<section class="service-detail">
  <div class="image-container">
    <img src="/servicesimages/water-tank.png" alt="Water Tanks Overview" />
  </div>

  <div class="text-content">
    <p>
          With over 15 years of experience, our team is equipped to manage projects from initial consultation through 
          to final installation, ensuring every tank meets orexceeds Australian standards. Whether for potable water or fire suppression systems,
          we focus on functionality, compliance, and longevity. Our work is carriedout with a high level of precision, efficiency, and care.
    </p>

    <h3>Our Services Include:</h3>

    <ul>
      <li>Refurbishment of aging or non-compliant tanks.</li>
      <li>Installation of new drinking water and fire tanks.</li>
      <li>Internal and external waterproofing.</li>
      <li>Roof replacement or upgrades.</li>
      <li>Internal cleaning, desludging, and disinfection.</li>
      <li>Vermin-proofing at critical access and base points.</li>
      <li>Replacement of damaged valves, floats, and access ports.</li>
      <li>Repositioning of manholes for safer access.</li>
      <li>Rust and corrosion treatment.</li>
    </ul>

    <p>
We understand the operational and safety risks posed by poorly maintained tanks. 
That’s why we offer ongoing scheduled maintenance programs for bothdomestic supply tanks and fire tanks, 
structured in line with AS 1851-2012 standards.These programs include routine inspections, compliance reporting,internal and external cleaning, component testing, and system optimisation to ensure your infrastructure remains reliable and fully operational year-round.
    <p>
What sets us apart is our commitment to sustainability, long-term value, and complete in-house delivery.
 We don’t subcontract critical tasks—our skilled teamhandles everything from confined space entry and high-risk work to water testing, 
 waste disposal, and detailed reporting. We also assist with projectdocumentation, site risk assessments, and service reports that align with your asset management systems.
    </p>

    <p>
Whether you need a single tank inspected or a complete site-wide refurbishment and maintenance strategy, 
TWS delivers reliable, high-quality watermanagement solutions designed to perform for years to come.    </p>
    </p>
  </div>
</section>


</Layout>